import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 335 | Perfect-Work Emperor-Immortal Institution Critique: Personal Dictatorship and Civilization Bet","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 335 | Perfect-Work Emperor-Immortal Institution Critique: Personal Dictatorship and Civilization Bet","no":335,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Perfect World","Emperor Immortal","Dictatorship","Civilization Bet","Institutional Critique"],"related":["49-Governance Framework and Power Checks","17-Plane Transcendent Standards","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0335_模块2-完美世界-个人独裁与文明押注.md","filePath":"en/0335_模块2-完美世界-个人独裁与文明押注.md"}'),a={name:"en/0335_模块2-完美世界-个人独裁与文明押注.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,m){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-335-perfect-work-emperor-immortal-institution-critique-personal-dictatorship-and-civilization-bet" tabindex="-1">Entry 335 | Perfect-Work Emperor-Immortal Institution Critique: Personal Dictatorship and Civilization Bet <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-335-perfect-work-emperor-immortal-institution-critique-personal-dictatorship-and-civilization-bet" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 335 | Perfect-Work Emperor-Immortal Institution Critique: Personal Dictatorship and Civilization Bet&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Perfect-Work Full Decomposition (Entry 12) | Benchmark base: Documents 49, 17, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-strongest-is-defaulted-as-most-deserving-to-rule" tabindex="-1">Introduction: When &quot;strongest&quot; is defaulted as &quot;most deserving to rule&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-strongest-is-defaulted-as-most-deserving-to-rule" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: When &quot;strongest&quot; is defaulted as &quot;most deserving to rule&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Perfect World&#39;s Emperor Immortal is both combat apex and the cosmos order&#39;s actual master. Heng Yuan Zhou does not object to strong ones being strong, but firmly objects to the default setting &quot;strongest = most deserving to dictate.&quot; This entry takes the six top-level axioms as base — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, law-first axiom (core), universal equal infinite law — to critique the Emperor Immortal institution. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>Shi Hao = extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong>.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Emperor Immortal institution&#39;s waste:</p><ul><li>Tying governance power to combat power makes the strongest person do the most trivial governance</li><li>The strong one&#39;s decision bandwidth filled by governance affairs, unable to continue evolution and construction</li><li>Myriad Ranks&#39; governance potential left idle</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Emperor Immortal institution&#39;s regression logic:</p><ol><li>Emperor Immortal present = dictatorship, absent = vacuum</li><li>The next Emperor Immortal is &quot;fought out,&quot; not &quot;elected&quot;</li><li>Every power handover is a bloody battle</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Emperor Immortal institution&#39;s essence is &quot;taking power by force&quot;:</p><ul><li>Whoever is strongest rules, no checks</li><li>Power does not come from Myriad-Rank authorization, but from combat power</li><li>Even if Shi Hao&#39;s conduct is flawless, the institution itself is still dictatorship — a good man&#39;s dictatorship is still dictatorship</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Emperor Immortal Institution (Power by Force)</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Governance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Strongest dictates</td><td>Anchor Council collective legislation</td></tr><tr><td>Handover by bloody battle</td><td>Myriad-Rank election and assessment</td></tr><tr><td>No checks</td><td>Three-powers separation + Anchor Supervisory Committee</td></tr><tr><td>Governance tied to person</td><td>Governance written into charter</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Plane Transcendent four-dimension assessment (Power 40 / Mind 25 / Contribution 20 / Responsibility 15) note: Heng Yuan Zhou recognizes strong ones&#39; status, but strong ones must pass contribution and responsibility assessment, not monopolize power through combat.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Replicate the Emperor-Immortal-dictatorship power structure</li><li>Inject two cases — &quot;dictatorship&quot; vs. &quot;collective governance&quot;</li><li>Count handover-period turbulence rate</li><li>Output &quot;Emperor-Immortal Institution Risk Report&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. The Emperor Immortal&#39;s power boundary is never clearly defined</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong>. Emperor Immortal count and permissions repeatedly rise and fall across the trilogy</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong></li></ul><p>Add one layer: the Emperor Immortal institution directly converts &quot;strongest&quot; into &quot;most deserving to rule,&quot; conflating two entirely different capability dimensions. Power solves &quot;can&quot;; governance solves &quot;should and whether good.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Plane Transcendent four-dimension assessment (Power 40, Mind 25, Contribution 20, Responsibility 15) precisely separates these two dimensions — you can be very strong, but to sit on the governance seat you must meet contribution and responsibility standards.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: strong-one bandwidth crowded out by governance</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: taking power by force = institutionalized predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo has no dictator&#39;s name but dictator&#39;s reality (bestowed); Shi Hao has dictator&#39;s reality; neither established checks</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad Ranks have no political participation right</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: dictatorial institutions cannot replicate to the multiverse</li></ul><p>Add one more layer: good-man dictatorship and bad-man dictatorship, structurally no difference. Because dictatorship&#39;s danger is not whether the dictator is good, but that once he exits, no mechanism catches the power. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants is not a better Emperor Immortal, but to make the Emperor Immortal position itself redundant.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-institutional-alternative-to-emperor-immortal-dictatorship" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Institutional Alternative to Emperor-Immortal Dictatorship <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-institutional-alternative-to-emperor-immortal-dictatorship" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Institutional Alternative to Emperor-Immortal Dictatorship&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Emperor Immortal institution&#39;s personal dictatorship and civilization bet, in Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s assessment, is one of the worst models of civilization governance. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s alternative is a Myriad-Ranks Republican Council plus the Alaya Network&#39;s distributed decision system; the law-first axiom ensures any &quot;Emperor-Immortal-tier&quot; decision must undergo charter review. The universal equal infinite law negates the legitimacy of &quot;one person represents all under heaven&quot; — people under heaven do not need a dictator to decide for them. The Emperor Immortal institution&#39;s republicanization essentially disperses power from one person&#39;s hands into the network.</p><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-plan-to-abolish-the-emperor-immortal-position" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Plan to Abolish the Emperor-Immortal Position <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-plan-to-abolish-the-emperor-immortal-position" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Plan to Abolish the Emperor-Immortal Position&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Emperor Immortal institution&#39;s republicanization is not swapping another person onto the Emperor-Immortal seat, but abolishing the position itself. Heng Yuan Zhou decomposes the Emperor Immortal&#39;s power into three functions: law maintenance to the Alaya Network, civilization decision-making to the Myriad-Ranks Republican Council, security to the Transcendent post system. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s law-first axiom ensures no single position can hold all power. The universal equal infinite law means the very concept of &quot;supreme power&quot; should not exist — every being inherently possesses infinite power, no heaven-acting dictator is needed.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Emperor Immortal institution directly converts &quot;strongest&quot; into &quot;most deserving to rule&quot;; this is predatory thinking&#39;s political endgame. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: being strong is not the same as ruling; order must come from Myriad Ranks republicanism, not from fists.</p><p>In the final analysis, Perfect World · personal dictatorship and civilization bet described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./333_模块2-完美世界-一人文明的终极脆弱.html">Entry 333 · Single-Handed Autocracy</a> · <a href="./350_模块2-完美世界-仙帝制度的共和化改造.html">Entry 350 · Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">49-Governance Framework and Power Checks</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',35)])])}const p=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{h as __pageData,p as default};
